& [UserIntent]
  + continue the Eclipse-to-Cantor integration toward a Cantor agent process that can perform useful auditable work
  + expose the published composed semantic inspection transaction through the smallest host-ready contract without prematurely granting host or effect authority
  + preserve the live C checkout and protected foreign narrative and keep filesystem process network provider model update remote and product effects outside this slice

